msgid ""
"A {dragon} Dragon can fly, increasing its rider’s move to 100cm, and it adds "
"[.edit]#+3/3# Attacks to those of its rider."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/dragon.adoc:10
msgid ""
"[.edit]#The {dragon} Dragon can breath fire if the character has joined a "
"unit that isn’t engaged in combat.# This is a shooting attack with a range "
"of 20cm, which can be directed against one target as normal. The breath has "
"3 Attacks, which are worked out in xref:rules:characters.adoc#characters-"
"that-shoot[the usual way]."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: en/revolution/modules/armies/partials/dragon.adoc:12
msgid ""
"Any unit joined by a character riding a {dragon} Dragon causes terror in its "
"enemies"
msgstr ""
